26   Preliminary remark access routes                                     000048
26                                                                        000049
26   For all routes required, a preservation of evidence                  000050
26   procedure is to be carried out with the respective                   000051
26   owner before the start of the works.                                 000052
26   The routes and site access roads used are to be                      000053
26   restored to their former condition after completion of               000054
26   the works and kept in a condition safe for traffic                   000055
26   during the construction period.                                      000056
26   Separate payment for maintenance and reinstatement is                000057
26   made only for the routes designated and to be used by                000058
26   the AN acc. to the bill of quantities, if individual                 000059
26   items are provided in the LV.                                        000060
26   Only the routes specified by the AG / site management                000061
26   may be used.                                                         000062
26   If further routes are used, no separate payment is                   000063
26   granted for maintenance and reinstatement.                           000064
26                                                                        000065
26   For all routes used, release certificates are to be                  000066
26   furnished by the AN after the end of construction.                   000067
26                                                                        000068
