26   @@                                                                   000177
26   Preliminary remarks                                                  000178
26                                                                        000179
26   Rainwater and surface water is to be kept away from the              000180
26   pipe trench and from the excavation pits as far as                   000181
26   possible by suitable measures. Its removal is not paid               000182
26   separately.                                                          000183
26                                                                        000184
26   Execution of dewatering acc. to ZTV point 2.1.                       000185
26   The dewatering works are executed as open dewatering                 000186
26   or, in partial areas, as closed vacuum dewatering with               000187
26   jetted wellpoints.                                                   000188
26                                                                        000189
26   For dewatering, the contractor has to keep available on              000190
26   site, taking into account a sufficient reserve, so many              000191
26   pump sets that during construction of the pipe                       000192
26   trenches, excavation pits etc. and during laying of the              000193
26   pipes the pipe trench or excavation pit bottom, socket               000194
26   and welding holes are free of water and dry. The                     000195
26   keeping available is covered by the site setup.                      000196
26                                                                        000197
26   All installations are to be operated fail-safe. If                   000198
26   required, an independent emergncy power supply is to be              000199
26   kept available on site and used. All machines and units              000200
26   used are to be kept available on site in                             000201
26   sound-insulated design in the vicinity of settlements.               000202
26   The costs for this are to be included in the unit                    000203
26   prices.                                                              000204
26                                                                        000205
26   The arrangement and use of the pump sets requires the                000206
26   approval of site management in each case. The use of                 000207
26   several pump units is only paid if these have to be                  000208
26   used simultaneously.                                                 000209
26                                                                        000210
26   To keep the waters clean, settling basins are installed              000211
26   before discharge into the receiving water.                           000212
26   Pollution of the receiving waters by input of fine                   000213
26   material from the dewatering is to be prevented by the               000214
26   AN by suitable measures. The cleaning of the receiving               000215
26   waters that may become necessary after completion of                 000216
26   the dewatering measures are to be carried out by the AN              000217
26   at his expense. Outside the valley floodplains the                   000218
26   PER029 can as a rule be discharged onto nearby forest                000219
26   plots. The discharge is to be agreed with site                       000220
26   management beforehand. Every pressure line is to be                  000221
26   equipped with a suitable and calibrated water meter                  000222
26   before the outlet. The meter readings are to be                      000223
26   recorded before commissioning and daily during                       000224
26   operation and submitted to site management. This work                000225
26   is to be included in the unit prices.                                000226
