26   @@                                                                   000348
26   The AN is responsible for calling off the material in                000349
26   line with the construction progresss.                                000350
26   The call-off is made directly with the supplying firm.               000351
26   The call-offs are to be notified to site management in               000352
26   writing.                                                             000353
26   The AN has to carry out the check of completeness of                 000354
26   the delivery and a 1. inspection for visible defects                 000355
26   (transport damage, such as e.g. damaged external                     000356
26   protection, spalling of the cement mortar lining).                   000357
26   With the takeover of the delivery, liability passes to               000358
26   the contractor!                                                      000359
26                                                                        000360
26   The AN is responsible for the return or removal of the               000361
26   packaging materials (e.g. steel straps, pipe caps                    000362
26   etc.).                                                               000363
26   The costs are to be included in the following items.                 000364
26   For supply and installation of fittings, the supply of               000365
26   the necessary seals, bolts, nuts and washers is to be                000366
26   included in the price.                                               000367
26   -   Seal approved for drinking water with steel inserts              000368
26   -   Bolts of V4A                                                     000369
26   -   Nuts and washers of V2A                                          000370
26                                                                        000371
26   The billing of the fittings is in principle by number                000372
26   of pieces, unless fittings are executed that are not                 000373
26   contained in the LV.                                                 000374
26   The fittings not contained are paid acc. to ZTV-Wa acc.              000375
26   to the corresponding item by actual length and fitting               000376
26   surcharges (see also shaft installation).                            000377
