26   Preliminary remarks                                                  000591
26                                                                        000592
26   The structures are billed as lump sums with the                      000593
26   exeption of the [ORT_00030] and special services.                    000594
26   Payment for the excavation of the excavation pit is                  000595
26   made acc. to ZTV-Wa, whereby, as an amendment, the                   000596
26   continuous pipeline is deducted.                                     000597
26                                                                        000598
26   The billing of the pipe material or of the installation              000599
26   is made according to shafts - installation.                          000600
26                                                                        000601
26   Materials and components                                             000602
26   For the supply of the ready-mixed concrete, only those               000603
26   supplying plants come into consideration that are                    000604
26   approved by the Supreme Building Authority for the                   000605
26   concrete consistencies to be supplied and have                       000606
26   contractually submitted to quality monitoring by a                   000607
26   recognised quality protection association or an                      000608
26   official testing body e.g. the Bayerische                            000609
26   Landesgewerbeanstalt.                                                000610
26                                                                        000611
26   The client reserves the right, if necessary, to inspect              000612
26   at the ready-mixed concrete plant the results of the                 000613
26   tests carried out during quality monitoring.                         000614
26                                                                        000615
26   The transport distance between supplying plant and                   000616
26   place of installation should as a rule not be greter                 000617
26   than 15 km. If, with good traffic conditions, supply                 000618
26   from ready-mixed concrete plants further away is                     000619
26   permitted, a suitable setting retarder that does not                 000620
26   impair the strength and other concrete properties is to              000621
26   be added to the concrete acc. to the processing                      000622
26   instructions of the manufacturing plant, without change              000623
26   to the contract prices. The same applies if concreting               000624
26   has to be done in hot or dry weather. The ready-mixed                000625
26   concrete to be used in the present case is to be                     000626
26   obtained from the supplying plant:                                   000627
26                                                                        000628
26                                                                        000629
26                                                                        000630
26   Approval and quality monitoring contract are still                   000631
26   valid.                                                               000632
26                                                                        000633
26   For every change of the ready-mixed concrete plant, the              000634
26   prior consent of site management is to be obtained,                  000635
26   whereby the same information as above is to be provided              000636
26   for the new supplying plant.                                         000637
