26   GENERAL DESCRIPTION SHAFT STRUCTURES                                 000679
26                                                                        000680
26   Gen. description of the execution of the shaft                       000681
26   structures. The concrete works are to be carried out                 000682
26   acc. to DIN 1045.                                                    000683
26   Only cement types that are resistant to acidic and                   000684
26   sulphate-containing soils may be used.                               000685
26                                                                        000686
26   The NOTES ON CONCRETING and the descriptions under                   000687
26   MATERIALS AND COMPONENTS in the preliminary remarks                  000688
26   must be observed without fail.                                       000689
26                                                                        000690
26   For new construction of walls, no separate payment is                000691
26   granted for any recesses.                                            000692
26                                                                        000693
26   The prices to be offered include all formwork and                    000694
26   falsework, together with accessories, the forming and                000695
26   closing of recesses, the appropriate curing of the                   000696
26   concrete together with all associated materials.                     000697
26   The concrete is to be executed in the area of the inner              000698
26   surfaces as smooth fair-faced concrete, otherwise rough              000699
26   as struck but free of honeycombing and fins.                         000700
26                                                                        000701
26   BLINDING LAYER                                                       000702
26   On the excavation pit bottom  or drainage or base                    000703
26   course, a 10 cm thick blinding layer of concrete C                   000704
26   12/15 with at least 190 kg Z/m³ is to be produced.                   000705
26                                                                        000706
26   BASE SLAB CONCRETE                                                   000707
26   in appropriate thickness acc. to structural calculation              000708
26   of reinforced concrete min. C 20/25 watertight, with                 000709
26   required reinforcement, with single-sided formwork,                  000710
26   incl. forming a pump sump in the dimensions 50 / 30 /                000711
26   30 cm and setting a fibre cement tray of the same size               000712
26   with perforated cover plate with recessed handle and                 000713
26   locking device of PER000115.                                         000714
26                                                                        000715
26   WALL CONCRETE                                                        000716
26   in appropriate thickness acc. to structural calculation              000717
26   of watertight reinforced concrete at least C 20/ 25                  000718
26   including the necessary reinforcement, formwork                      000719
26   (multi-sided) etc., inner surfaces fair-faced concrete.              000720
26                                                                        000721
26   SLAB CONCRETE                                                        000722
26   Thickness acc. to structural calculation of watertight               000723
26   concrete at least C20/ 25 including the necessary                    000724
26   reinforcement, formwork etc. Inner surfaces are to be                000725
26   produced as fair-faced concrete.                                     000726
26   The top side of the F0101 is to be screeded off to                   000727
26   falls.                                                               000728
26                                                                        000729
26   JOINT TAPE                                                           000730
26   Inserting an elastic construction joint tape approx.                 000731
26   200 mm wide in all construction joints.                              000732
26                                                                        000733
26   SAND FILLING                                                         000734
26   The pipelines are to be carefully packed underneath and              000735
26   surrounded with sand in the excavation pit area.                     000736
26                                                                        000737
26   [FIRMA_00091]                                                        000738
26   On the base slab a [FIRMA_00091] at least 3 cm thick,                000739
26   finely floated, smoothed in mix ratio 1:3 , the last                 000740
26   coat of pure cement, laid to falls, is to be supplied                000741
26   and applied.                                                         000742
26   Particular attention is to be paid to gap-free adhesion              000743
26   of the screed to the substrate.                                      000744
26                                                                        000745
26   Per m³ approx.  370 - 400 kg pea gravel 0/8 are to be                000746
26   used.                                                                000747
26   Screed thickness:     min 30 mm, min. 2 % fall                       000748
26                                                                        000749
26   Before placing, the concrete slab is to be cleaned of                000750
26   all foreign matter, well wetted and a cement mortar                  000751
26   slurry mix ratio 1:2 is to be brushed in with stiff                  000752
26   brooms as bonding layer.                                             000753
26                                                                        000754
26   The difficulties for placing the screed underneath                   000755
26   built-in parts such as pipelines etc. are to be                      000756
26   included in the price.                                               000757
26                                                                        000758
26   Supply and produce ready for use.                                    000759
26                                                                        000760
26   SHAFT NECK (ACC. TO DETAIL DRAWING)                                  000761
26   construct of reinforced concrete acc. to DIN 1045 as                 000762
26   described before, with the required reinforcement.                   000763
26   The dimensions are:                                                  000764
26                                                                        000765
26   Clear width   100 x 80 cm, tapered to 80 x 80 cm,                    000766
26   or              100 x 120 cm, tapered to 100 x 100 cm.               000767
26                                                                        000768
26   Concrete thickness acc. to structural analysis.                      000769
26   The inner formwork is to be made of smooth fair-faced                000770
26   concrete formwork.                                                   000771
26   The inner edge F0101-shaft neck is to be chamfered by                000772
26   inserting a triangular fillet and a drip groove is to                000773
26   be provided.                                                         000774
26                                                                        000775
26   SHAFT COLLAR                                                         000776
26   of fine concrete with min. 300 kg Z/m³ and a grain size              000777
26   up to at most 8 mm, incl. the required steel inserts,                000778
26   the visible surfaces are to be smoothed, the edge                    000779
26   chamfered, concrete cross-section 25 x d + 5 cm, clear               000780
26   opening 80 / 80 cm or 100 / 100 cm.                                  000781
26                                                                        000782
26   EQUIPMENT (IN PER000115)                                             000783
26                                                                        000784
26   STAINLESS STEEL COVER                                                000785
26   Manhole cover rainproof, square, of PER000115 material               000786
26   1.4301/1.4307, acc. to DIN 1239.                                     000787
26   Cover of stainless steel sheet, raised in the middle,                000788
26   with internal cross stiffening, with self-latching lock              000789
26   that can be opened with a special operating key, with                000790
26   two PER000115 gas springs (650 N), with an integrated                000791
26   hold-open device releasable only by hand, guided by a                000792
26   pull-off-proof U-profile (holder of the gas spring                   000793
26   welded through on three sides), with sturdy hinges,                  000794
26   arranged concealed for protection against vandalism.                 000795
26   With a circumferential, completely closing insect-proof              000796
26   rubber seal (frost- and weather-resistant),                          000797
26   replaceable, clamped into a cover groove. Cover with                 000798
26   insulation of CFC-free rigid polyurethane foam,                      000799
26   protected on the underside by stainless steel sheet.                 000800
26   The rigid foam injected into the cover in liquid form,               000801
26   thereby gap-free filled cavity. With handle as opening               000802
26   aid, fitted centrally on the cover. With welded-on                   000803
26   angles for subsequent mounting of a magnetic contact,                000804
26   incl. fixing screws.                                                 000805
26   Frame of angle profile, flanged on both sides, with                  000806
26   four vertically welded-on lugs for anchoring with                    000807
26   dowels inside the shaft,                                             000808
26   as lift-off protection (one dowel lug per side), per                 000809
26   frame side with three drill holes for anchoring with                 000810
26   dowels from above.                                                   000811
26   With two additional frame fixings in the area of the                 000812
26   two gas springs manhole cover and frame welded under                 000813
26   shielding gas, pickled in immersion bath and                         000814
26   passivated.                                                          000815
26   Including corresponding operating key and fixing                     000816
26   material and sealing tape.                                           000817
26   e.g. company FIR62, Berching or equivalent design                    000818
26                                                                        000819
26   Make offered:                                                        000820
26                                                                        000821
26                                                                        000822
26   PER000115 AIR INLET AND VENT PIPE                                    000823
26   Supply air inlet pipes of PER000115 DN 150 with a                    000824
26   ventilation cowl screwed on at the upper end and                     000825
26   cylindrical protective screen of corrosion-resist.                   000826
26   material, the cowl fixing screws on the inside, and                  000827
26   install in the shaft slabs, including the required pipe              000828
26   clamps.                                                              000829
26   In the slab area a fixed flange is to be provided. The               000830
26   pipe is to begin approx. 30 cm above the shaft floor.                000831
26   The cross-section is to be kept free in the first 30 cm              000832
26   in order to install a fan. OK of the vent pipe at the                000833
26   level of vent pipe OK of the shaft cover e.g. make:                  000834
26   FIRMA_062 or equivalent design                                       000835
26                                                                        000836
26   Make offered:                                                        000837
26                                                                        000838
26                                                                        000839
26                                                                        000840
26   SAFETY ACCESS LADDER OF PER000115                                    000841
26   Supply and install a  safety fixed ladder, with type                 000842
26   approval of RW TÜV, in accordance with DIN EN 14396,                 000843
26   DVGW 351, BGV D 36 "Ladders and steps", entirely of                  000844
26   PER000115, material 1.4301 (V2A).                                    000845
26   Stiles of special profile of high stiffness (57 x 25 x               000846
26   2,5 mm), covered at the top with PVC caps.                           000847
26   Rungs of U-profile with perforated tread surface, 30                 000848
26   mm, (acc. to UVV). Step height 280 mm, clear ladder                  000849
26   width 400 mm.                                                        000850
26   Ladder for vertical installation. Including 150 mm                   000851
26   long, height-adjustable wall fixing brackets for dowel               000852
26   fixing.                                                              000853
26   Safety fixed ladder entirely welded under shielding                  000854
26   gas, pickled in immersion bath and passivated.                       000855
26                                                                        000856
26   Incl. fold-up, extendable access aid, entirely of                    000857
26   PER000115, material 1.4301 (V2A), at least 1.000 mm                  000858
26   above top edge of floor. (Upper fixing device fully                  000859
26   assembled).                                                          000860
26   Suitable for ladder width 400 mm.                                    000861
26   The ladder is to be assembled so that the first tread                000862
26   is max. 28 cm above FFB of the shaft floor, the first                000863
26   rung top edge must begin at - 10 cm from the top edge                000864
26   of the shaft collar.                                                 000865
26                                                                        000866
26   The fixing material used is to be chosen in PER000115,               000867
26   whereby screws with machine thread and expansion                     000868
26   anchors of PER000115 are to be chosen. (e.g. Fischer                 000869
26   Einschlaganker EA V4A or equivalent design)                          000870
26                                                                        000871
26   Ladder with fold-out holding device for shaft width S =              000872
26   100 cm or 80 cm.                                                     000873
26                                                                        000874
26   Lengths stated without holding device.                               000875
26                                                                        000876
26   e.g. make:  FIR62 or equivalent design                               000877
26                                                                        000878
26   Make offered:                                                        000879
26                                                                        000880
26                                                                        000881
26   COVER PUMP SUMP:                                                     000882
26   Perforated stainless steel cover, 3 mm thick as cover                000883
26   of the sump, perforation diameter 10 mm, pitch 50 mm,                000884
26   with recessable handle, with locking device on the                   000885
26   underside.                                                           000886
26                                                                        000887
26   ATTENTION                                                            000888
26   All small parts and fixing material for the                          000889
26   above-mentioned built-in parts is to be supplied and                 000890
26   installed by the AN.                                                 000891
26   The costs for this are to be included in the price. The              000892
26   fixing material used is to be chosen in PER000115,                   000893
26   whereby screws with machine thread and expansion                     000894
26   anchors of PER000115 are to be chosen.                               000895
26                                                                        000896
26   All parts required are to be ordered by the AN, on his               000897
26   responsibility, in one order.                                        000898
26   For one delivery the transport costs are borne by the                000899
26   AG.                                                                  000900
26   Costs for further deliveries are to be borne by the AN,              000901
26   likewise returns due to wrong or faulty information in               000902
26   the order.                                                           000903
