26   Preliminary remarks                                                  000931
26                                                                        000932
26   For this division the latest editions in each case of                000933
26   the following apply in addition:                                     000934
26                                                                        000935
26   ZTV-WA pressure pipes general                                        000936
26   ZTV-WA PERSON_027ß pipes                                             000937
26   ZTV-WA PVC and PE pipes                                              000938
26                                                                        000939
26   Bolted connections are to be executed in V2A or V4A.                 000940
26                                                                        000941
26   When stainless steel pipes are used, the bolted                      000942
26   connections are likewise to be chosen in PER000115.                  000943
26                                                                        000944
26   Every bolt head (V2A) and every bolt nut (V4A) is to be              000945
26   provided with a washer (V4A).                                        000946
26                                                                        000947
26   The bolt lengths are to be chosen so that at least 1                 000948
26   thread turn and at most 3 thread turns protrude from                 000949
26   the nut.                                                             000950
26                                                                        000951
26   Only seals with steel insert may be used as seals.                   000952
26                                                                        000953
26   The makes of machines, valves, instruments, devices                  000954
26   etc. named by the bidder in the individual items are to              000955
26   be stated bindingly and entered by name in the places                000956
26   provided for this.                                                   000957
26                                                                        000958
26   The pipelines are to be assembled so that no stresses                000959
26   whatsoever occur in the pipelines.                                   000960
26   The AG will check compliance with this requirement by                000961
26   loosening flanges and, in case of non-observance,                    000962
26   insist on remedy at the expense of the AN.                           000963
26                                                                        000964
26   For connections PER000115-cast iron, an electrical                   000965
26   isolation point is to be installed at the bolted                     000966
26   connections.                                                         000967
26   For all fittings and valves with EK coating, washers of              000968
26   GRP are additionally to be installed to protect the                  000969
26   coat-ing.                                                            000970
26                                                                        000971
26   The closing of all pipe penetrations through slabs,                  000972
26   walls and external walls and the setting of pipe                     000973
26   supports in masonry or concrete is paid separately.                  000974
26                                                                        000975
26   A C H T U N G  !                                                     000976
26                                                                        000977
26   All bolts are to be tightened with a torque wrench acc.              000978
26   to the manufacturer's instructions.                                  000979
26                                                                        000980
26   The entire installation is to be protected with                      000981
26   sheeting until the final coat or until shortly before                000982
26   acceptance of the work.                                              000983
26                                                                        000984
26   Provisional pipe supports (spacing 1,5 m) for the                    000985
26   assembly are to be included in the unit prices.                      000986
26                                                                        000987
26   Lines projecting from the shafts or buildings as well                000988
26   as pipe ends are always to be kept closed (close                     000989
26   watertight after the respective day's work).                         000990
26                                                                        000991
26   The contractor has to draw up a list of pipe, fitting                000992
26   and valve requirements and an assembly drawing with                  000993
26   isometric representation and hand them over to site                  000994
26   management for checking in triplicate in good time                   000995
26   before the material order.                                           000996
26   The corrosion protection of the valves is to be ensured              000997
26   by enamel or EK coating.                                             000998
