26   As-built survey of the water pipeline                                001062
26   As-built recording of the water pipeline system                      001063
26   (pipeline route, bends, valves, transfer shafts, casing              001064
26   pipes, drains, third-party lines and the like) in the                001065
26   official European Terrestrial Reference System 1989                  001066
26   (ETRS 89) (7-digit) and in the official height                       001067
26   reference system DHHN2016.                                           001068
26   The required surveying works are to be carried out                   001069
26   professionally by qualified personnel and at the open                001070
26   pipe trench.                                                         001071
26   Accuracy requirements:                                               001072
26   Positional accuracy: +/- 3 cm                                        001073
26   Height accuracy: +/- 2 cm                                            001074
26                                                                        001075
26   Procuring suitable official height benchmarks is the                 001076
26   responsibility of the AN.                                            001077
26                                                                        001078
26   As-built documentation water pipeline                                001079
26   Site plan 1:2000 or 1:1000:                                          001080
26   From the measured coordinates and other information                  001081
26   (gradient, dimension, material, cadastral parcel                     001082
26   numbers, etc.) an as-built drawing acc. to DIN 2425                  001083
26   O016 1 is to be prepared, whereby the latest status of               001084
26   the ALKIS data must be visible as background.                        001085
26                                                                        001086
26   Preparing longitudinal sections                                      001087
26   Sections 1:1000/100                                                  001088
26   To be entered are, among other things, the ground                    001089
26   levels, the trench bottom of the line, line lengths and              001090
26   gradient details.                                                    001091
26                                                                        001092
26   The drawings are to be handed over, signed by the                    001093
26   contractor, as colour plots in duplicate and digitally               001094
26   in dwg format or dxf format (ACAD 2010).                             001095
26                                                                        001096
26   The coordinate list incl. Z coordinate (GOK and WL                   001097
26   level in the provisional system) for the                             001098
26   above-mentioned points is to be handed over in ASCII                 001099
26   format (as specified by AG) suitable for transfer into               001100
26   the GIS system Smallworld of the AG, in addition to                  001101
26   this also a survey record that is to be signed by the                001102
26   persons responsible ( surveyor ).                                    001103
